{"title":"2024 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_13\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 13</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Easy_and_Fast)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Easy and Fast)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Coordinate_Geometry_and_AM-GM_Inequality)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Coordinate Geometry and AM-GM Inequality)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(⚡Very_Fast⚡)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (⚡Very Fast⚡)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5_(Gradient)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5 (Gradient)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_13\">Problem 13</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 13\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/f/e6f8dd0d6df33a6e24ecda9ebe7fbfda5c96d75b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y,h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> that satisfy the system of equations<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/1/6e1b822d6a797e597019f3e2dec998e71d787585.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 + y^2 - 6x - 8y = h\\]\" width=\"173\" height=\"19\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/e/81e93689500b6956b5b22642888c380e29c2a60e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 + y^2 - 10x + 4y = k\\]\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />What is the minimum possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/2/6a21c96c484c74df54998c34377063c3ca990ddc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h+k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"45\" height=\"16\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/4/ad4b53d45ee92af5b97461c6fc4fbc8a83070b7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }-54 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }-46 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) }-34 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) }-16 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) }16 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"523\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Easy_and_Fast.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Easy_and_Fast)\">Solution 1 (Easy and Fast)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Easy and Fast)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Adding up the first and second equation, we get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/b/9bb065a60c552435c117fdeabbac2f768d970272.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} h + k &amp;= 2x^2 + 2y^2 - 16x - 4y \\\\ &amp;= 2x^2 - 16x + 2y^2 - 4y \\\\ &amp;= 2(x^2 - 8x) + 2(y^2 - 2y) \\\\  &amp;= 2(x^2 - 8x + 16) - (2)(16) + 2(y^2 - 2y + 1) - (2)(1) \\\\ &amp;= 2(x - 4)^2 + 2(y - 1)^2 - 34 \\end{align*}\" width=\"468\" height=\"130\" />\nAll squared values must be greater than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. As we are aiming for the minimum value, we set the two squared terms to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>This leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/d/aed9fd4af6975205832b5fef4a2c05f0114a7b10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\min(h + k) = 0 + 0 - 34 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)} -34}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"299\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~mitsuihisashi14\n~minor edits by Sophia866\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Coordinate_Geometry_and_AM-GM_Inequality.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Coordinate_Geometry_and_AM-GM_Inequality)\">Solution 2 (Coordinate Geometry and AM-GM Inequality)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Coordinate Geometry and AM-GM Inequality)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2024_amc_12B_P13_V2.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/b/b2/2024_amc_12B_P13_V2.PNG/500px-2024_amc_12B_P13_V2.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"388\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/b/b2/2024_amc_12B_P13_V2.PNG/750px-2024_amc_12B_P13_V2.PNG 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/b/b2/2024_amc_12B_P13_V2.PNG 2x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/e/9ae17badb0db86f1f929a000c426857df7dd376a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x-3)^2 + (y-4)^2 = h + 25\\]\" width=\"221\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/5/3359dd10b43d4594313208fe47bbaa76e2b1767a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x-5)^2 + (y+2)^2 = k + 29\\]\" width=\"220\" height=\"20\" />\nThe distance between 2 circle centers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/5/83572b102bca95476f4268f1a7111291af8f7e69.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(O_{1}O_{2})^2 = (5-3)^2 + (4 - (-2)) ^2 = 40\\]\" width=\"303\" height=\"20\" />\nThe 2 circles must intersect given there exists one or more pairs of (x,y), connecting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/1/4d1464f7eebf9ec06c4602e21659b966da2588de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O_{1}O_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" /> and any pair of the 2 circle intersection points gives us a triangle with 3 sides, then    \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/d/e9d61686d20a6ae035b157840c1ef6c2f4777cfb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[radius (O_{1}) + radius (O_{2}) \\geq O_{1}O_{2}\\]\" width=\"264\" height=\"18\" /> \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/8/bf88d198b54e21e2bc39578f250c0b90d16ba34d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{h+25} + \\sqrt{k+29}   \\geq  2\\cdot\\sqrt{10}\\]\" width=\"233\" height=\"19\" />\nNote that they will be equal if and only if the circles are tangent,\n</p><p>Applying the AM-GM inequality (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/0/c50aba4e474554f2845326a2195546977323d1fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(a^2 + b^2) \\geq (a+b)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"165\" height=\"21\" />) in the steps below, we get  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/c/32ca303b4f306d3bb7501a1ce7113a518393722d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[h + k + 54 = (h + 25) + (k + 29) =\\sqrt{(h + 25)}^2 + \\sqrt{(k + 29)}^2 \\geq \\frac{\\left(\\sqrt{h + 25} + \\sqrt{k + 29}\\right)^2}{2} \\geq   \\frac{\\left(2\\sqrt{10}\\right)^2}{2} = 20.\\]\" width=\"787\" height=\"55\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/9/e79f2c7045ee0c7d40f74fdae7b855f01a7fd32c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h + k \\geq 20 - 54 = \\boxed{C -34}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"218\" height=\"27\" />.  \n</p><p><br />\n~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Cyantist\">luckuso</a>,~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:ShortPeopleFartalot\">[1]</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2024_AMC_12B_P13.jpeg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/1/16/2024_AMC_12B_P13.jpeg/600px-2024_AMC_12B_P13.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"849\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/1/16/2024_AMC_12B_P13.jpeg/900px-2024_AMC_12B_P13.jpeg 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/1/16/2024_AMC_12B_P13.jpeg 2x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>~Kathan\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28.E2.9A.A1Very_Fast.E2.9A.A1.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(⚡Very_Fast⚡)\">Solution 4 (⚡Very Fast⚡)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (⚡Very Fast⚡)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Begin by completing the square for each equation:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/e/9ae17badb0db86f1f929a000c426857df7dd376a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x-3)^2 + (y-4)^2 = h + 25\\]\" width=\"221\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/5/3359dd10b43d4594313208fe47bbaa76e2b1767a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x-5)^2 + (y+2)^2 = k + 29\\]\" width=\"220\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>We notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea768618848c1aea8a32490c327911e8ab7243a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> minimizes the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fdd76dce64a49b9983634f47665eb6fea886cc31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-3)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/4/964c9ebffbb4ce3b25dfff13b75c53488a0cbcee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-5)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"19\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/234b330118777aba0bee513e3ade547ebd70d845.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> minimizes the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/6/176bb5aae7f35048eb3cd3dbf3cc49947a86427b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y-4)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"64\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/9/9d9581e635343837905d695464395b3ae6247340.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y+2)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"19\" />. Plug those values into both equations to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/e/adef3facb915c79244e7b3a8b198522c210a3b3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 9 = h + 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"117\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/a/25a4ca93b7d6dcfd6725a764c42a010c951178b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 9 = k + 29$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"117\" height=\"16\" />. Add the two equations to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/c/45ccb9180fb57f787691c720f18a670208a74ede.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 = h + k + 54$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"127\" height=\"16\" />. Therefore, the minimum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/2/112d0914646970be353b3992c3cc77bb1bc54670.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h + k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"45\" height=\"16\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/2/dc293e1f6334b84e9de18869b02f609078cfb87d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)} -34}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"82\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~GeoWhiz4536\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5_.28Gradient.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5_(Gradient)\">Solution 5 (Gradient)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5 (Gradient)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/2/112d0914646970be353b3992c3cc77bb1bc54670.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h + k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"45\" height=\"16\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/9/259f266fa2d6cf8a046dfaad75fd04da69435bb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = 2x^2 + 2y^2 - 16x - 4y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"228\" height=\"21\" />.\nTo minimize, set the gradient to 0.\nThe gradient is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/2/8f2e5313929f94a7ac36fdb93c1d2459b70d5adb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[4x-16, 4y-4]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"130\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/7/2e7d65cfa316d639c9267398009812f3eb45fea9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c3b4834614e5e7e189cb7d621cfb4fb0bd36dd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />. \nPlugging this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" />, the minimum value is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/2/dc293e1f6334b84e9de18869b02f609078cfb87d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)} -34}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"82\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~vaishnav\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution 1 by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a 